<title>UK: Proudfoot back in black with warning, no div.</title>
<headline>Proudfoot back in black with warning, no div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence, adjusted)  1.4 profit	   vs 1.5 profit</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.5 profit	   vs 5.8 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   35.2		   vs 38.9</p>
<p>NOTE - UK management consulting services group Proudfoot Plc warned that year profits may fall below first-half levels because of &quot;an adverse geographical mix of billing and lower volume levels.&quot; Comparative figures were after an exceptional charge of 7.9 million stg following a major reorganisation.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 2.33 profit	  vs 6.12 loss</p>
<p> Exceptional		*			vs *</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.70		   vs 0.24</p>
<p> Tax charge		 1.41		   vs 0.90</p>
<p> Net taxed		  1.12 profit	  vs 6.69 loss</p>
<p> Retained result	  1.11 profit	  vs 6.70 loss</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
